  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thematic Evaluation of EU support to SMEs and Business Organisation in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The aim is to contribute to the definition of a EUD medium term action plan for SMEs and Business Organisation in Lebanon, with an overall independent sectoral assessment of the performance of EU interventions. This assignement will include (i) an inventory of all the projects funded by EU in the sector since 2006 (ii) a Thematic Evaluation of EU interventions undertaken that provides direction for (a) future programme (s) or/and MIP.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
